// Foundation's clock.
//
// The wall-clock time, for a program that needs to know when it is rather than
// only how long to wait — `sleepMilliseconds` is the second, this is the first.
// It rides the same `kira_network` archive Foundation already links, so reaching
// it names no new library.

// The time now, in milliseconds since the Unix epoch.
function unixMillis() -> Int {
    return kira_network_unix_millis()
}
